WEBVTT

00:17:28.329 --> 00:17:32.026
za koji Severno-američko
veksilološko udruženje smatra

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:35.449
da ima najgoru gradsku zastavu
u Severnoj Americi.

00:17:36.159 --> 00:17:38.056
[Ponosan sam što sam iz Pokatela]

00:17:38.076 --> 00:17:39.926
(Smeh)

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:42.532
(Aplauz)

00:17:43.896 --> 00:17:45.047
Da.

00:17:45.071 --> 00:17:46.221
(Aplauz)

00:17:46.242 --> 00:17:48.877
Ljudi, ta stvar ima zaštitni znak na njoj.

00:17:48.901 --> 00:17:50.916
(Smeh)

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.628
Boli me da je i pogledam.

00:17:52.652 --> 00:17:53.882
(Smeh)

00:17:53.915 --> 00:17:55.836
Hvala puno što ste me slušali.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:58.712
(Aplauz)